      "username": "kitmehsu",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/kitmehsu/{size}/1901_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-10T12:27:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Okay, thanks for the speedy response, &nbsp;I knew of the ruling on out of turn overdrive, hence my indicision. So captain cosmic does the one thing that I didn't think possible, made me enjoy using fixer. Also, I would not use that team on any one other than the enead as the complete and utter lack of any ongoing/environment destruction was painful, even against them.&nbsp;</p>",
