      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Okay, thanks for the speedy response, &nbsp;I knew of the ruling on out of turn overdrive, hence my indicision. So captain cosmic does the one thing that I didn&#39;t think possible, made me enjoy using fixer. Also, I would not use that team on any one other than the enead as the complete and utter lack of any ongoing/environment destruction was painful, even against them.&nbsp;</p>",
