      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Try Fixer with Skyscraper.</p><p>Use Micro-Assembler to get Jackhandle.</p><p>Use Compulsion Canister to deal 2 irreducible damage to all non-hero targets. &nbsp;Twice.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Micro Assembler also lets you have turns where you play Charge then put Grease Gun into play from your deck.</span></p><p>DW Fixer + Tiny Sky-Scraper is amazing, since she can return 2 links from the trash, and only 1 from the field destroying Compulsion Canisters is actually a positive.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">I believe the alternate title for</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">&nbsp;</span><em style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">Wrath of the Cosmos</em><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">is</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">&nbsp;</span><em style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">Rise of the Fixer.</em></p>",
